CloudRcade
An independently maintained fork of webRcade (https://github.com/webrcade/webrcade).
Original webRcade copyright and Apache-2.0 license notices are retained.
CloudRcade modifications, 2026: configurable deployment, Nextcloud integration,
touch controls, offline caching, library/history, clock handling, PlayStation
streaming, optional Azahar-based 3DS application and runtime BIOS loading, and
experimental PPSSPP-based PSP support.
The scanner runs inside the app at startup and on an env-configured schedule.
This project is not endorsed by webRcade, Nintendo, or the emulator authors.
